I think we should hold ourselves off from deciding on a calendar until after
we've decided what /names/ to use. That said, my vote is to use whatever
calendar is official to your locality. Choosing a calendar may be more
important if/when jbogugde actually, physically exists, but until then, it's
just "being different to be different", AFAIAC.

On Fri, Jan 28, 2011 at 9:53 AM, Oren <get.oren@gmail.com> wrote:

> On the topic of "culturally neutral, logical datekeeping," is there a
